SUMMARY:Aqua Aerobics
DTSTART:20260824T110000Z
DTEND:20260824T114459Z
UID:gladstone-AL1GXAA12000525-2026-08-24T11:00:00Z@activeleicester
DESCRIPTION:Spaces Remaining: 0\n\nAqua aerobics is a class performed in w
 ater to music and great for those who wishing to exercise without high imp
 act. Water is a fantastic resistance tool for a whole body workout!\n\nBoo
 k session: https://activeleicester.gladstonego.cloud/book
LOCATION:Aylestone Leisure Centre - Teaching Pool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Swim (16+)
DTSTART:20260824T190000Z
DTEND:20260824T195959Z
UID:gladstone-AL1MPAO20000525-2026-08-24T19:00:00Z@activeleicester
DESCRIPTION:Spaces Remaining: 24\n\nAdult swim session for ages 16+. Enjoy
  a respectful and safe environment. Shower before and after swimming. Appr
 opriate swimwear required. Please inform staff of any medical conditions\n
 \nBook session: https://activeleicester.gladstonego.cloud/book
LOCATION:Aylestone Leisure Centre - Main Pool Lane 1
END:VEVENT
